Map data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Map data is © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database
License (ODbL) 1.0.

    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

This application renders that data in two ways. Offline, it draws vector tiles
from a PMTiles archive (built through the OpenMapTiles schema) that the user
supplies on the SD card. Online, it can fetch raster tiles from third-party
services. In neither case is map data redistributed with this software.

Tile schema: OpenMapTiles. Tile archive format: PMTiles.

